DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
6400::$$$message_0046_0000_0000$$$::I disappear into the woods behind the temple.[lr]::
6401::$$$message_0046_0000_0001$$$::The vast, mountainous landscape below my eyes reminds me how pure and unadulterated nature still is out here.[lr]::
6402::$$$message_0046_0000_0002$$$::When I remember that the Einzbern Forest lies beyond this mountain, it makes the familiar scene feel like something from a foreign land.::
6403::$$$message_0046_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
6404::$$$message_0046_0001_0001$$$::I've been out this way and seen these sights many times before. It shouldn't feel special after all this time.[lr]::
6405::$$$message_0046_0001_0002$$$::I squint my eyes at the blazing sunlight.[lr]::
6406::$$$message_0046_0001_0003$$$::I close my eyes at the breathtaking vista.[lr]::
6407::$$$message_0046_0001_0004$$$::Somehow, this quiet makes me feel at ease. If I forget about my worries and rest here, I bet I could stay here taking in the sights until the stars come out.::
6408::$$$message_0046_0002_0000$$$::"...Now's not the time for that. I can come back and enjoy this another time."[lr]::
6409::$$$message_0046_0002_0001$$$::Winter break could work...but everything would be snowed in by then. We can have another campout here next summer, then. I think a picnic would make everyone happy.::
6410::$$$message_0046_0003_0000$$$::"Next year, huh... That's so far off."[lr]::
6411::$$$message_0046_0003_0001$$$::What'll even be left of this place by then? That's a different story.[lr]::
6412::$$$message_0046_0003_0002$$$::I grunt and stretch my back, then leisurely leave the cemetery.iqMÃ